# Uploaded files in local dev.
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `storage/` also matches
# packages/storage, which silently kept that whole workspace package out of git.
# Every Vercel build failed with "Cannot resolve '@gymx/storage'" while local
# builds passed, because the package existed on disk but was never committed.
/storage/
